<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Oct unemployment falls to 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Oct unemployment falls to 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's unemployment rate in October fell to a seasonally-adjusted 1.9 percent from 2.0 percent a year earlier, provisional National Statistical Office (NSO) figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>						   Oct   Sept   Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)		     1.9    1.9     2.0</p>
<p>						  (1.8)  (1.8)   (1.9)</p>
<p>Note: Seasonally unadjusted figures in brackets. The NSO figures showed the economically active population rose to 21.68 million in October from 21.31 million a year ago and 21.56 million in September.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
